  <entry>
    <title>一些未分类 Android 属性备份</title>
    <link href="/2026/02/17/%E4%B8%80%E4%BA%9B%E6%9C%AA%E5%88%86%E7%B1%BB%E5%A4%87%E4%BB%BD/"/>
    <url>/2026/02/17/%E4%B8%80%E4%BA%9B%E6%9C%AA%E5%88%86%E7%B1%BB%E5%A4%87%E4%BB%BD/</url>
    
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>音量阶数</p><figure class="highlight ini"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs ini"><span class="hljs-attr">ro.config.media_vol_steps</span>=num<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>关闭 Selinux (部分系统无效）</p><figure class="highlight ini"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs ini"><span class="hljs-attr">ro.boot.selinux</span>=disable<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>开启 adb 并打开无线调试 </p><figure class="highlight ini"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs ini"><span class="hljs-attr">persist.service.adb.enable</span>=<span class="hljs-number">1</span><br><span class="hljs-attr">service.adb.tcp.port</span>=<span class="hljs-number">5555</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>取消 adb 调试验证并设置为调试模式</p><figure class="highlight ini"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs ini"><span class="hljs-attr">ro.secure</span>=<span class="hljs-number">0</span><br><span class="hljs-attr">ro.adb.secure</span>=<span class="hljs-number">0</span><br><span class="hljs-attr">ro.debuggable</span>=<span class="hljs-number">1</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>伪装 data 已加密</p><figure class="highlight pgsql"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs pgsql">ro.crypto.state=<span class="hljs-keyword">encrypted</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>模拟无实体按键</p><figure class="highlight ini"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs ini"><span class="hljs-attr">qemu.hw.mainkeys</span>=<span class="hljs-number">0</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>禁用系统救援程序</p><figure class="highlight ini"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs ini"><span class="hljs-attr">persist.sys.disable_rescue</span>=<span class="hljs-literal">true</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>允许显示 OEM 解锁开关</p><figure class="highlight ini"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs ini"><span class="hljs-attr">ro.oem_unlock_supported</span>=<span class="hljs-number">1</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure>]]></content>
    
    
    
